  "id": "give-and-go-shooting",
  "title": "Give and Go Shooting",
  "description": "A half-ice drill that mimics a situation that happens again and again in games: players learn to read the pressure, get a pass back to the corner, and execute a give-and-go. The first player passes out to the point man, then attacks. The point man bank passes back to the next player in line, who executes a give and go with the point man, and the point man shoots. The player who attacked becomes the new point man. Key points: read and react, give and go, quick shots.",
